<p>Der Karpfen <hi rendition="#aq">(Cyprinus carpio)</hi>. Bauchflo&#x017F;&#x017F;er.</p></figure><lb/>
<pb n="33" facs="#f0039"/>
<figure><head>Fig. 938.</head><lb/>
